"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":167867026,"digest":"sha256:aa0434ef4e69755426ddf144bacaa495bf2401217b56d9524e425eaf77b418dc","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-10-09T04:40:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T04:41:08Z"},{"id":623909314,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84lMBnC","name":"ReasonixStudio-windows-arm64.zip.minisig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":289,"digest":"sha256:3f85dd819d93b29bd4d6958bb8fda8947d5b5eb97782f5f099956d4cb8d454f6","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-09T04:40:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T04:40:59Z"},{"id":623909329,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSIatD84lMBnR","name":"SHA256SUMS","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":564,"digest":"sha256:0cd555ebabfaf48a73045f4dc07fe06d8423a1af170264c0a4cb0d56309978f7","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-09T04:40:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T04:41:00Z"}],"body":"本版把图标栏移到窗口最左侧并加入反馈入口与三档显示方式，新增模型选择器搜索与分组、HTML 文件页面预览和「视觉效果」节能档，补齐终端界面的多个按键，并修复队列编辑、回退重发、反馈截图和带天空主题包长时间占用显卡的问题。\n\n## 新增\n\n- 图标栏移到窗口最左边，底部新增带未读角标的「发送反馈」入口；外观页「图标栏」改为始终显示（默认）／仅侧栏折叠时显示／从不显示，立即生效 (#12428)\n- 输入框的模型选择器带搜索框（输入即过滤，回车选第一项，Esc 关闭），按服务商分组并固定显示分组标题，条目改为单行，当前模型保留勾选，声明可读图的模型带「读图」标记 (#12442)\n- 工作台文件浏览器里打开 `.html`/`.htm` 文件时，标签页新增「预览」视图（默认）：按网页打开，同目录的样式、脚本、图片照常加载，文件变化后自动刷新，未保存的草稿不会被覆盖 (#12443)\n- 设置的外观页「高级外观」新增「视觉效果」：完整（默认）／节能。节能档去掉磨砂玻璃、动态天空和颗粒，布局不变；只作用于本机，立即生效 (#12448)\n- 终端界面的工具审批和计划审批卡片支持用 `j`/`k` 和 `Ctrl+N`/`Ctrl+P` 移动光标 (#12419 by @xxoingr)\n- 终端界面的提问卡片支持 `j`/`k` 上下移动、`h`/`l` 在问题之间左右切换 (#12420 by @xxoingr)\n- 终端界面的 `/mcp` 面板支持 `l`/右方向键进入服务的工具列表，`h`/左方向键返回或关闭面板，`q` 直接关闭 (#12421 by @xxoingr)\n- 终端界面在开启应用内鼠标捕获时，没有选中文字的右键会粘贴剪贴板里的文字，与 1.x 一致，通过 SSH 连接时仍显示原有提示；输入框隐藏时不粘贴 (#12436 by @xxoingr)\n- 终端界面在回合运行中按 `Ctrl+Enter`，把输入框内容作为引导发送，效果与 `Ctrl+S` 相同，在下一个工具边界送达；空闲时按它不做任何事，不会把想换行的草稿提交出去 (#12437 by @xxoingr)\n\n## 变更\n\n- 打开会话窗格时，MCP、改动、上下文和队列不再在状态返回前后各读取一次；在测试夹具里这四项各由两次降为一次，实际耗时变化尚未实测 (#12344 by @KHG420)\n- Go 工具链升到 1.26.9、网络库 `golang.org/x/net` 升到 v0.60.0，清除漏洞扫描对本程序报告的 11 项可达漏洞，扫描结果为 0；只影响构建，没有源码改动 (#12446)\n\n## 修复\n\n- 带天空的主题包不再让显卡持续满载：天空画布降到每秒 15 帧，窗口不可见或失焦时停绘，面板模糊改为更实的底色。RTX 3060 上空闲占用从 9.3% 降到 1.0%，集成显卡未实测 (#12448)\n- 连续点击队列里两条的「编辑」时，先点的那条较晚返回，不再覆盖后点那条的编辑框和未保存的草稿；较早的拒绝提示也不再盖掉已打开的编辑框 (#12411 by @KHG420)\n- 编辑已发送的消息并重发时，如果回退失败，编辑框保留修改的文字并在原处显示错误，可直接重试，不再关闭编辑框后什么都没发出去 (#12426 by @KHG420)\n- 反馈截图还在读取时提交反馈再点「再写一条」，上一条的截图不再混进下一条反馈 (#12423 by @KHG420)\n- 打开反馈对话框后，焦点偶尔停在标签页上而不进入正文输入框的问题已修复 (#12439)\n- 已发送消息里粘贴或上传并保存的图片现在显示预览；图片读取失败时保留预览框并显示「图片不可用」，竖图不再撑出预览框 (#12332 by @KHG420)\n- 标题栏的设备面板在云端访问离线时，会区分说明是未登录、中继不可达还是中继拒绝，不再一律显示为未登录 (#12429 by @icebear02)\n- 终端界面输入框里调出了多行历史条目后，上下键可以继续往更早的条目翻，不再卡在该条目的第一行 (#12435 by @xxoingr)\n- 项目里声明的 MCP 服务启用后，若命令、参数、环境变量或网址被改动，会回到「待授权」并显示将要启动的命令；升级后已启用的项目服务会再询问一次 (e2d8eba20, GHSA-j7r7-jh9q-wrq2)\n\n## 贡献者\n\n感谢本版本的贡献者：@xxoingr、@KHG420、@icebear02\n\n## What's Changed\n* feat(studio): icon rail at the far left, with feedback and three display modes by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12428\n* docs(readme): say what Reasonix does in plain words by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12424\n* fix(studio): preserve message edits when rewind fails by @KHG420 in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12426\n* perf(studio): avoid duplicate reads before the session is known by @KHG420 in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12344\n* docs: UI-change section in the PR template and a 1.x parity table by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12432\n* fix(studio): keep the latest queued edit selection by @KHG420 in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12411\n* fix(studio): keep pending screenshots within their feedback draft by @KHG420 in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12423\n* fix(tui): j/k and Ctrl+N/Ctrl+P move the approval cursor by @xxoingr in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12419\n* fix(tui): j/k and h/l drive the question card by @xxoingr in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12420\n* chore(deps-dev): bump source-map-js from 1.2.1 to 1.2.2 in /workers/crash-report by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12408\n* chore(deps): bump tinypool and vitest in /workers/crash-report by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12409\n* fix(tui): q, h/l and Left/Right in the MCP manager by @xxoingr in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12421\n* test(studio): wait for the pane's subscription before emitting into it by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12438\n* fix(studio): move focus into the feedback body after the environment has committed by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12439\n* fix(studio): explain why Internet device access is unavailable by @icebear02 in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12429\n* fix(studio): preview saved image attachments in user messages by @KHG420 in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12332\n* fix(tui): history recall walks past a multi-line entry by @xxoingr in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12435\n* fix(tui): right-click with no selection pastes clipboard text by @xxoingr in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12436\n* fix(tui): Ctrl+Enter steers a running turn by @xxoingr in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12437\n* feat(studio): group, search and mark the composer model picker by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12442\n* feat(studio): open an HTML file from the explorer as a page preview by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12443\n* test(mcp): make the enable-binding tests hold on Linux by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12454\n* refactor(tui): bring onKey back under the complexity budget by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12447\n* chore(deps): bump Go toolchain to 1.26.9 and x/net to v0.60.0 by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12446\n* perf(studio): stop a sky pack and frosted panels from keeping the GPU busy by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12448\n* fix(feedback-sync): count only stable studio tags and merged closing PRs by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12450\n* docs(release): Studio 2.33.0 release notes by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12456\n\n## New Contributors\n* @icebear02 made their first contribution in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12429\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/compare/studio-v2.32.0...studio-v2.33.0\n\n\n---\n\n**macOS** 已用 Developer ID 签名并公证，打开时不需要清除隔离属性。**Windows** 的窗口、内核与安装器都经 Certum 代码签名证书做了 Authenticode 签名。**Linux** 从 `.deb` 安装。\n\n三个平台都能自更新：Linux 走自己的包，Windows 运行下一个安装器，macOS 替换自身 bundle。\n","mentions_count":5}
